WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-CA

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.380
What does change look like?

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.674
It can be small.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.634
It can be big.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:15.974
What can we start to imagine 

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.934
to be a better world?

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:21.438
We’re trying to push forward.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:25.025
Problem solving is not 
like a straight line.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:28.319
You need to take risks
and think outside the box.

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:31.197
To be able to cope with 
the path winding

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.866
in a different directions.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.826
To tackle a grand challenge,

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:37.662
you can't just do it by yourself.

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:40.665
The real problems in our world 
have not been solved before.

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:42.792
You actually need to come 
up with something new.

00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:47.338
You need a different skill sets 
around you

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:49.507
to help move things forward.

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:51.593
To think differently,

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:54.763
get a different perspective
on what's possible.

00:00:55.513 --> 00:00:58.266
It's about reimagining the future,

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:01.269
and the first step is to 
not run away from it.

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:10.653
I know that what I'm doing 
has a place in the world.

00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:13.823
When you're personally invested,
there's a huge sense of purpose.

00:01:13.823 --> 00:01:15.492
That takes you a long way.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.786
You need to take that 
knowledge into your job, 

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.329
into community experience,

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:21.539
turning it to a greater purpose.

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:23.792
And we're all here for the same task,

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.460
to make a difference in this world.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.880
I want to leave the world
in a better place than I found it.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:32.383
We have the tools and we have the will.

00:01:32.383 --> 00:01:34.844
It just fuels the fire in me.

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:36.846
That drive never goes away.

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:39.641
It's all the reasons

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:41.684
for all the things we've learned,

00:01:41.684 --> 00:01:44.938
and all the things we 
still need to discover

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.523
in our world, 

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:48.108
in ourselves

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:50.068
and in each other.

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:53.571
What we need to pass on
is that sense of fearlessness.

00:01:53.571 --> 00:01:56.825
Think about things in ways
that they haven't been thought of before.

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:58.827
Because when that light comes on,

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:03.206
that's an amazing moment.

